---
import "./SectionHome.css";
---

<section id="about" class="section-home-container">
  <div class="home-container__left">
    <h2 class="home-left__name"><b>.</b> Álvaro <span>Bravo</span></h2>
    <div class="home-left__subtitle-name">
      {"<"}
      <span class="home-left__subtitle-name-text" id="typing-text"></span>
      {"/>"}
    </div>
    <div class="home-left__text-container">
      <p>
        Soy <span class="resaltar">Fullstack Engineer</span> con stack <span
          class="resaltar">MERN</span
        >, obsesionado con encontrar la <span class="resaltar"
          >solución más creativa</span
        > a cada problema — del diseño de la <span class="resaltar"
          >base de datos</span
        > a la <span class="resaltar">interfaz</span>, de punta a punta.
      </p>
      <p>
        Si buscás a alguien que <span class="resaltar">piense distinto</span> y <span
          class="resaltar">ejecute con precisión</span
        >, estás en el lugar correcto.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="home-left__btn">
      <button class="home-left__btn-cv btn"
        >Curriculum
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="24"
          height="24"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          ><path
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="2"
            d="M12 5v14m0 0l6-6m-6 6l-6-6"></path></svg
        >
      </button>
      <button class="home-left__btn-contact btn">Contacto</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="home-container__rigth"></div>
  <div class="scroll-signal">
    <div class="icons icons-desk">
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        width="24"
        height="24"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        ><path
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          stroke-width="1"
          d="M12 10V7m6 2v6a6 6 0 0 1-12 0V9a6 6 0 1 1 12 0"></path></svg
      >
    </div>
    <div class="icons icons-phone">
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        width="24"
        height="24"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        ><path
          fill="currentColor"
          d="M12 19.75a.74.74 0 0 1-.53-.22l-6-6a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L12 17.94l5.47-5.47a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 1.06l-6 6a.74.74 0 0 1-.53.22"
        ></path><path
          fill="currentColor"
          d="M12 19.75a.76.76 0 0 1-.75-.75V5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0v14a.76.76 0 0 1-.75.75"
        ></path></svg
      >
    </div>
    <span>Scroll</span>
  </div>
  <script src="./sectionHome.js"></script>
</section>
